  "question": "If $\\int_1^4 f(x)dx = 7$, then what is the value of $\\int_4^1 f(x)dx$?",
  "answeroption": "C",
  "explanation": "Property of definite integrals: $\\int_a^b f(x)dx = -\\int_b^a f(x)dx$.<br /><br />Thus $\\int_4^1 f(x)dx = -\\int_1^4 f(x)dx = -7$.",
  "explanation_image": [],
